@EventTicketingApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5066

### Register a normal user. Supply registrationPassword privately in your HTTP client.
POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "{{registrationPassword}}",
  "firstName": "Example",
  "lastName": "Customer"
}

### Create an organizer as an admin. Supply adminAccessToken and accountPassword privately.
POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organizer@example.com",
  "password": "{{accountPassword}}",
  "firstName": "Example",
  "lastName": "Organizer",
  "role": "EventOrganizer"
}

###

GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/countries
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/countries/1
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/countries/by-name?name=Jordan
Accept: application/json

### Create a country in the local development database

POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jordan",
  "shortName": "JO"
}

### Update: replace both IDs with the ID returned by POST

PUT {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/countries/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Jordan",
  "shortName": "JO"
}

### Delete: use an existing country ID without associated venues

DELETE {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/countries/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create venue: use an existing country ID

POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/venues
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Royal Hall",
  "city": "Amman",
  "address": "Main Street",
  "countryId": 1,
  "capacity": 100
}

### Get venue: replace ID with the one returned by POST

GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/venues/1

### Update venue: route and body IDs must match

PUT {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/venues/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Royal Hall",
  "city": "Amman",
  "address": "Main Street",
  "countryId": 1,
  "capacity": 120
}

### Delete venue: must have no associated events

DELETE {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/venues/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### List events
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events

### Get event: replace with the ID returned by POST
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/1

### Create event: use an existing venue ID; send dates in UTC
POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Music Workshop",
  "description": "An introductory workshop",
  "startDate": "2027-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2027-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 100,
  "venueId": 1
}

### Full event update: route/body IDs must match
PUT {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Music Workshop",
  "description": "Updated workshop",
  "startDate": "2027-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2027-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 120,
  "venueId": 1
}

### Delete event: remove associated ticket categories first
DELETE {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Paged country search (names and short names)
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/countries?search=Jo&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Paged venues: filters can be combined
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/venues?countryId=1&city=Amman&search=Hall&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Paged events: inclusive event-start date range, using UTC
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events?search=Music&venueId=1&countryId=1&city=Amman&startFrom=2027-01-01T00:00:00Z&startTo=2027-12-31T23:59:59Z&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Invalid page size should return 400
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events?pageSize=101


### Create category: use an existing event ID with sufficient unallocated capacity
POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "General Admission",
  "description": "Standard entry",
  "price": 15.50,
  "capacity": 60,
  "eventId": 1
}

### Get category: use the ID returned by POST
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket-categories/1

### Filter categories by event, text, price range, and page
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket-categories?eventId=1&search=General&minPrice=0&maxPrice=20&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Full category update: the current allocation is excluded from the capacity check
PUT {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket-categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "General Admission",
  "description": "Standard entry",
  "price": 20.00,
  "capacity": 50,
  "eventId": 1
}

### Delete category and free its allocation
DELETE {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/ticket-categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a booking as the authenticated customer (use existing event/category IDs)
POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "items": [{ "ticketCategoryId": 1, "quantity": 2 }]
}

### Paged own booking history
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/mine?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Own booking details
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel all remaining tickets (at least 24 hours before event start)
POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Partial cancellation: cumulative total of 1 cancelled ticket on this own booking item
POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "bookingItemId": 1, "cancelledQuantity": 1 }]
}

### Public availability (cancelled tickets become available again)
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/1/availability

### Event booking history: admin or this event's organizer only
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/1/bookings?status=Confirmed&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Current authenticated profile and roles (use the final HTTPS API URL in browsers)
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### One-day event: date-only end includes the selected day
POST {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amman Hall event",
  "description": null,
  "startDate": "02/02/2027",
  "endDate": "02/02/2027",
  "capacity": 5,
  "venueId": 1
}

### Own events: Admin/EventOrganizer only, scoped to the authenticated account
GET {{EventTicketingApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/mine?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
